# Planted bugs for the Counter fixture.
run fv-tlc Counter.tla Holds.cfg Witness.cfg LiveFair.cfg
properties Bounded ReachesMax
file Counter.tla

mutation the increment ignores the bound
detects Bounded
- Next == x < Max /\ x' = x + 1
+ Next == x <= Max /\ x' = x + 1

mutation the counter stops one short
detects ReachesMax
- Next == x < Max /\ x' = x + 1
+ Next == x < Max - 1 /\ x' = x + 1

harmless a comment on Init
- Init == x = 0
+ Init == x = 0  \* the counter starts at zero
